      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "A lightweight REST API layer built on top of the Atina JDE Microservice.\nExposes curated JD Edwards operations through standard OpenAPI-\nbased endpoints.\nSimplifies integration for external applications, portals, and custom\nservices.\nIdeal for modern API-led architectures and non-MuleSoft integration\nscenarios.",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "A lightweight REST API layer built on top of the Atina JDE Microservice.\nExposes curated JD Edwards operations through standard OpenAPI-based endpoints.\nSimplifies integration for external applications, portals, and custom services.\nIdeal for modern API-led architectures and non-MuleSoft integration scenarios.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
