      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1779131245596,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Enables the development of custom JD Edwards web services on top of\nthe Atina Microservice.\nThe tooling can generate an IntelliJ-ready project to accelerate\nimplementation.\nCustom-developed services can be packaged together with the standard\nJDE libraries and deployed as part of the same bundle.",
      "fontSize": 54.53683035714282,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Enables the development of custom JD Edwards web services on top of the Atina Microservice.\nThe tooling can generate an IntelliJ-ready project to accelerate implementation.\nCustom-developed services can be packaged together with the standard JDE libraries and deployed as part of the same bundle.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
